","text":"神奈川県出身、22歳の遠藤光莉(えんどうひかり)です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ﾟ+｡::ﾟ｡:.ﾟ｡+｡｡+.:ﾟ｡:.ﾟ｡+｡｡+.｡ﾟ:;｡+ﾟ+｡:"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"以前のさくみみで皆さんとお約束していた、冬優花さんとの「Dead end 」Dance practice動画を、明日の21時にトークに送りますー📮✨"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202202/mobQfhbeu.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1stツアーバージョンで前半、後半に分けて撮ったので、前半→冬優花さん 後半→私でアップしたいと思います！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"是非見に来てください🎥✨"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ﾟ+｡::ﾟ｡:.ﾟ｡+｡｡+.:ﾟ｡:.ﾟ｡+｡｡+.｡ﾟ:;｡+ﾟ+｡:"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日もブログを読んでいただきありがとうございました☺︎"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"次のブログも読んでいただけたら嬉しいです!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"では！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"光莉💜🦋"}],"source":"official"},"ofc-hina-65477":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"                      やまっほ〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"愛知県生まれ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"はるはること"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"山下葉留花(やました はるか)です🌱"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"⋱⋰ ⋱⋰ ⋱⋰ ⋱⋰ ⋱⋰ ⋱⋰ ⋱⋰ ⋱⋰ ⋱⋰ ⋱"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"- 8 / 20 -"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は水曜日ですね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私は水曜日に近づくとソワソワします"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どうしてかっていうと、\n水曜日は、おひさまとお話できる時がどれくらいなのか知ることができる日だからです"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"遠回しに言っちゃいましたが、ミート＆グリートのお話です！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"火曜日の夜とかドキドキが止まらないんです"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","tex